<#7fc8ff>ICE GAUGE / SHATTER</>
Shatter (ice gauge full)		^X
  Every Bufula hit chills the opponent and fills the ice
  gauge (bottom of the screen). At full, X on the ground
  becomes Shatter: a rapier thrust that freezes the target
  in place for about a second, then launches. It spends the
  gauge. Also cancels a light or crouching normal on contact.

<#7fc8ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Works in the air too.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U

<#7fc8ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium		^A / ^B
  A chains into A, A, then Coup Droit; A and A,A chain into B.
Heavy (Artemisia)		^C
Artemisia strike		^X
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Crouching Heavy / Artemisia strike		_D^C / _D^X
Air Light / Medium		^A / ^B
Air Heavy / Artemisia strike		^C / ^X

<#7fc8ff>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (500 meter).
Bufula (ice, calls Artemisia)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Coup Droit (rapier thrust)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Getsu-ei		^B_+^X

<#7fc8ff>SUPERS (1 bar)</>
Myriad Arrows A		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Myriad Arrows B		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^B_+^C
